    "zh_CN": "[em2][信义][/em2]「[给他三百钱]」",
    "links": [55]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 58,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「還是算了，太麻煩。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "zh_CN": "「还是算了，太麻烦。」",
    "links": [2079]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 59,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "SetContinueMode(false);\nSetContinueMode(original)@Message(EndRoll);\nContinue()@Message(EndRoll);\nBeginDiceRoll(Manual,RealpolitikCheck,12);",
    "links": [60]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 60,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「按照江湖規矩，這入夥費得先欠著。等我發達了，再一次付清！先把鍋子給我吧！」",
    "Sequence": "ModifyData(DnDAlignment,Player,GoodEvil,-0.15);",
    "zh_CN": "「按照江湖规矩，这入伙费得先欠着。等我发达了，再一次付清！先把锅子给我吧！」",
    "links": [61, 63]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 61,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「這叫『放長線釣大魚』，懂嗎？現在少吃一口肉，將來還你一整頭豬！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);",
    "Conditions": "IsPassDice()  == true;",
    "zh_CN": "「这叫『放长线钓大鱼』，懂吗？现在少吃一口肉，将来还你一整头猪！」",
    "links": [62]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 62,
    "actorID": "role106",
    "text": "「長線……大魚？好！鍋子……給你！敲它……我就來！」",
    "Sequence": "ModifyData(FeatExp,Player,Persuasion,20);ModifyData(Valuable,Player,Summon_Pot,1);",
    "zh_CN": "「长线……大鱼？好！锅子……给你！敲它……我就来！」",
    "links": [2078]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 63,
    "actorID": "role106",
    "text": "「不！騙子！沒錢……不給！」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Conditions": "IsPassDice()  == false;",
    "zh_CN": "「不！骗子！没钱……不给！」",
    "links": [64]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 64,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「切，被識破了……好吧好吧，給你錢就是了。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=11);",
    "zh_CN": "「切，被识破了……好吧好吧，给你钱就是了。」",
    "links": [2081, 2080]
  },
  {
